rmation about you and a friend\n\nA: What books have you already read?\n\nB: I've already read Tom Sawyer and Harry Potter.\n\nA: What do you think of them?\n\nB: Well, I think Harry Potter was exciting, but Tom Sawyer was a bit boring.\n\n\n<table border=1 style='margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;'><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>You</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Your friend</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Comments</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Books I have already read</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Movies I have already seen</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Songs I have already heard</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'></td></tr></table>",
